stdout | Diff two `elp lint --format=json` JSONL artifacts
stdout |
stdout | Usage: elp lint-compare [OPTIONS] --base <BASE_JSONL> --diff <DIFF_JSONL>
stdout |
stdout | Options:
stdout |       --base <BASE_JSONL>          JSONL artifact for the **base** side of the comparison (typically
stdout |                                    an `elp lint --format=json` run at a prior project state).
stdout |                                    Diagnostics present here but missing on the diff side are
stdout |                                    reported as removed
stdout |       --diff <DIFF_JSONL>          JSONL artifact for the **diff** side of the comparison (typically
stdout |                                    an `elp lint --format=json` run at the current project state).
stdout |                                    Diagnostics present here but missing on the base side are
stdout |                                    reported as new
stdout |       --report-path <REPORT_PATH>  Optional path to write the Markdown comparison report
stdout |                                    (per-(diagnostic, severity) summary table) to. When omitted, the
stdout |                                    report is written to stdout
stdout |   -h, --help                       Print help
stdout |
stdout | Global options:
stdout |       --log-file <LOG_FILE>  
stdout |       --erl <ERL>            
stdout |       --escript <ESCRIPT>    
stdout |       --no-log-buffering     
stdout |       --no-buck-generated    Deprecated (no-op): buck project loading always builds generated code
stdout |       --buck-quick-start     Deprecated (no-op): buck project loading always builds generated code
stdout |       --color <WHEN>         Use color in output [default: always] [possible values: always, never,
stdout |                              auto]
